  "blocks": {
    "question-body": {
      "id": "question-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "question-ask",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "圆是最光滑的形状，没有一个尖角。可是把几个转动的圆一个接一个串起来，最后一个圆上的笔，能画出一个带尖角的音符。这节课回答：要几个圆，每个圆多大、转多快？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "series-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "z(t)=c_0+\\sum_{n\\ne 0} c_n e^{\\,int},\\qquad 0\\le t<2\\pi"
        },
        {
          "id": "question-reading",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "把平面上的点看成复数 z=x+iy。每一项 cₙeⁱⁿᵗ 是一个圆：半径是 |cₙ|，笔每画一圈它转 n 圈，n 的正负决定转的方向。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "circles-body": {
      "id": "circles-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "circles-explain",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一个圆只能画圆。在它的边上再放一个小圆，让小圆反向转两圈，笔画出的曲线就被掰出三个角。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "two-circles-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "z(t)=e^{\\,it}+0.36\\,e^{-2it}"
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "circles-scene": {
      "id": "circles-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "circle-chain",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "fit-body": {
      "id": "fit-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "fit-explain",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先在音符的轮廓上等距取 1024 个点，再用离散傅里叶变换算出每个圆的半径和起始角度。图中只保留最大的 N 个圆，按大小串起来。虚线是目标轮廓；右边是误差：每个点与笔的位置之差的均方根，相对于轮廓的大小。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dft-equation",
          "type": "math",
          "value": "c_n=\\frac1M\\sum_{k=0}^{M-1} z_k\\,e^{-2\\pi i nk/M},\\qquad M=1024"
        },
        {
          "id": "fit-corners",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "注意尖角：圆少的时候，曲线在尖角处冲过头又绕回来，留下小小的波纹。圆越多，波纹越贴近尖角，但不会完全消失。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "fit-scene": {
      "id": "fit-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "fourier-fit",
      "parameters": {
        "shape": "note",
        "terms": [
          1,
          2,
          4,
          8,
          16,
          32,
          64
        ]
      }
    },
    "try-body": {
      "id": "try-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "try-predict",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先猜：五角星有十个尖角、十条直边，要几个圆才能画像？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "try-scene": {
      "id": "try-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "fourier-star",
      "parameters": {
        "shape": "star",
        "terms": [
          2,
          4,
          16,
          64
        ]
      }
    },
    "code-body": {
      "id": "code-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "code-explain",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "下面就是本课计算系数的函数。换一组点，就能画出别的轮廓。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "series-code": {
      "id": "series-code",
