      ]
    },
    "next-body": {
      "id": "next-body",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "next-try",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "五角星转过五分之一圈后和原来一样，所以只有转速 n 除以 5 余 1 的圆不为零，两个圆就已经有五个角。试着改 epicycles.ts 里的形状，先预测要几个圆，再看结果。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "back-to-site",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "../promo/lecture.json",
